---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
description: "Visit Big Mike's Market & More at 3000 James Street in Syracuse, New York."
---
{% from "_components/index.njk" import button %}

<article class="bg-black">
  <header class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-red-800/50">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/big-mikes-hero.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_45%] opacity-40"
      loading="eager"
      eleventy:ignore
    >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/90 via-black/65 to-black/35"></div>
    <div class="container relative flex min-h-[30rem] max-w-7xl flex-col justify-center py-16 md:min-h-[38rem] md:py-20 lg:min-h-[44rem]">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">Big Mike's Market &amp; More</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-balance text-zinc-50">About Big Mike's Market &amp; More</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100 md:text-xl">
        A neighborhood deli built around fresh food, generous portions, and friendly service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="container max-w-7xl py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem]">
      <section class="border border-red-800/70 bg-zinc-900/80 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-950/40">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-300">Visit or call ahead</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-50">Location Details</h2>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="border border-red-800/60 bg-black/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Address</h3>
            <address class="mt-3 not-italic text-zinc-100">3000 James Street<br>Syracuse, NY 13206</address>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-red-800/60 bg-black/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Phone</h3>
            <a href="#" @click.prevent class="mt-3 block text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-300 no-underline hover:text-amber-200">Phone coming soon</a>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-red-800/60 bg-black/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Hours</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-50">7:00AM–2:00AM</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-red-800/60 bg-black/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Halal Food</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-zinc-100">Chicken and lamb platters, gyros, and more made fresh to order.</p>
          </div>
          </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="border border-red-800/70 bg-zinc-900/80 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-950/40">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-50">Order Info</h2>
        <div class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-zinc-100">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Call Us</p>
            <a href="#" @click.prevent class="mt-1 block text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-300 no-underline hover:text-amber-200">Phone coming soon</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Store Hours</p>
            <p class="mt-1 font-bold">7:00AM–2:00AM</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-red-300">Known For</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Breakfast · Halal Food · Toasted Sandwiches</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8">
          {{ button({
            text: "View Menu",
            url: "/menu/",
            variant: "primary",
            full: true
          }) }}
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
